61f49b5d9d23e1edbae37087a20c6bcf243799d7161b","text":"补充规定 <第32013号，2021年9月24日>\n\n本法令自2021年9月24日起生效。\n\n计算执法处罚的标准（与第23-4条相关）\n■ 教师申诉条例 [附表] <2021年9月24日新增>                                \n\n  计算执法处罚的标准（与第23-4条相关）                                               \n\n  （单位：10,000 韩元）                                                                      \n\n┌──────────────┬─────────┬───────────────┐\n\n│위반행위                    │근거 법조문       │이행강제금 금액               │\n\n│                            │                  ├───┬───┬───┬───┤\n\n│ │ │1 次 │2 次 │3 次 │4 次 │\n\n├──────────────┼─────────┼───┼───┼───┼───┤\n\n│1. 拒绝续聘、解雇、免职，│该法第10-4条第1款 │1,000 │1,300 │1,600 │2,000 │\n\n│关于解雇和取消任命 │ │ │ │ │ │\n\n│未遵守整改令│││││││\n\n├──────────────┼─────────┼───┼───┼───┼───┤\n\n│2. 前 │《关于停职和降职的法律》第10-4条第1款 │500 │750 │1,000 │1,400 │\n\n│未遵守命令│││││││\n\n├──────────────┼─────────┼───┼───┼───┼───┤\n\n│3. 关于减薪、训诫和停职 │本法第十条之四第一款 │300 │500 │700 │900 │\n\n│未遵守整改令│││││││\n\n├──────────────┼─────────┼───┼───┼───┼───┤\n\n│4. 其他不利处置 │本法第十条之四第一款 │200 │300 │400 │500 │\n\n│未遵守整改令│││││││\n\n└──────────────┴─────────┴───┴───┴───┴───┘"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00001","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018334","source_hash":"28fa1c91bad1c7a415fa93f4f2fc6a5f5d07394891a429d0afdcc28d1071fe08","text":"■ 教师申诉条例 [附表] <2021年9月24日新增>"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00002","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018335","source_hash":"2d63c0c86c28fdacfc39e7460dadaa77dbdbd4935a17a5113c6419d88ed6fdd9","text":"计算执法处罚的标准（与第23-4条相关）"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00003","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018336","source_hash":"48266d53f26f1d052cd0f43f502bc9a1625a0add24b355fe20ac1d61152871ca","text":"(单位：10,000 韩元)"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00004","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018337","source_hash":"903aa577eae3314c52694d8cb0c32f8a688802c384b7267385dc97b9afdad866","text":"违规"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00005","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018338","source_hash":"f301e09bb088a35ead5a94b8a5272800ed1989bf2a850f142c6a2bc9c86559d4","text":"法律依据"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00006","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018339","source_hash":"c1fc5538cc1fb5ecc808f584ddf0ba8f2003dbd4cdb4416d7db7dfce77139012","text":"强制执行罚款金额"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00007","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018340","source_hash":"4da4b59cbfd66518a897d218064dc6a845afee02d516e1aa110b8d210daccd96","text":"1 次"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00008","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018341","source_hash":"b3aba0b413acf7c30e8024efdb3c316561fd66d87ce9ea9fea1aeafe5fbd2f0b","text":"第二次违规"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00009","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018342","source_hash":"cfe5ecf17362a926a6c6e609a0edacd7e80f706658fcca366b6e2b7415c6d873","text":"第三次违规"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00010","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018343","source_hash":"7ee7e2514a7565841bf4822fcd023e5daa18cd5d47beb6a94d5ca0333f348699","text":"4 次"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00011","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018344","source_hash":"a3907f1dc0024dafb0ad80077c76d85592c654f71bf05cfba782c06a2af639fb","text":"1. 拒绝续聘、解雇、终止，"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00012","doc":"A28335","law_id":"kr-002571-235639-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2018345","source_hash":"74bce396d7b41c265e0d75134a77e11de20966cd60cdf0d5228dd108d748e81c","text":"《法》第10-4条第1款"},{"id":"A28335-zh-00013","doc":"A283